Keep a shared count as 0.
For every spot from 0 to 6.
Place 0 into seen.
Place 0 into distance.

Place 0 into queue.
Set item 0 of seen to 1.
Set item 0 of distance to 1.
The head is 0.
Set count to 1.
To expand from current (a whole number) with candidate (a whole number).
If candidate is more than 6, return.
If item candidate of seen is 1, expand from current with candidate plus 1, return.
Set firstword to item current of words.
