Compare from 0 with 2.
If apart is 1, set item candidate of seen to 1, set item candidate of distance to item current of distance plus 1, Place candidate into queue, add 1 to count.
Expand from current with candidate plus 1.

Repeat while head is less than count.
The current is item head of queue.
Add 1 to head.
Expand from current with 1.

